WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Browse five PreStocks baskets. Predict and Cover use test money on the build before the Canton port; Hold opens a desk draft.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose a basket and adjust the holdings and cash sleeve. Drafting needs no seat.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Set limits. The app labels which checks a live desk's contract would enforce and which the desk's own code enforces.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The optional test read needs a signed message, uses paper cash and sends no transaction.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Creating the practice desk also needs a signed message. This tour stops before any signature.
